{'symbol': 'SPGI', 'date': '2021-05-03 18:47:00', 'title': 'R1 RCM SET TO JOIN S&P MIDCAP 400; BANCORP TO JOIN S&P SMALLCAP 600', 'text': 'NEW YORK, MAY 3, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0S&P SMALLCAP 600 CONSTITUENT R1 RCM INC. (NASD:RCM) WILL REPLACE PERSPECTA INC. (NYSE:PRSP) IN THE S&P MIDCAP 400 AND THE BANCORP INC. (NASD:TBBK) WILL REPLACE R1 RCM IN THE S&P SMALLCAP 600 EFFECTIVE PRIOR TO THE OPENING OF TRADING ON FRIDAY, MAY 7.\xa0 VERITAS CAPITAL IS ACQUIRING PERSPECTA IN A DEAL EXPECTED TO BE COMPLETED SOON PENDING FINAL CONDITIONS.'}{'symbol': 'SPGI', 'date': '2021-05-02 18:00:00', 'title': "NEW ZEALAND'S EXCHANGE AND S&P DOW JONES INDICES LAUNCH CARBON-EFFICIENT INDICES", 'text': 'WELLINGTON, NEW ZEALAND, MAY 2, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0NEW ZEALAND\'S EXCHANGE ("NZX") TODAY LAUNCHED NEW ZEALAND\'S FIRST CARBON EFFICIENT INDICES IN PARTNERSHIP WITH THE WORLD\'S LEADING INDEX PROVIDER, S&P DOW JONES INDICES ("S&P DJI"), AMID RAPIDLY GROWING INVESTOR INTEREST, AND ACTION GLOBALLY TO REDUCE CARBON EMISSIONS AND ADDRESS CLIMATE CHANGE. NEW ZEALAND\'S FIRST \'CARBON LIGHT\' INDEX ALIGNED WITH BEST GLOBAL PRACTICE, THE TWO NEW INDICES, S&P/NZX 50 CARBON EFFICIENT INDEX\xa0AND S&P/NZX 50 PORTFOLIO CARBON EFFICIENT INDEX, UTILISE TRUCOST\'S ENVIRONMENTAL DATASET TO WEIGH COMPANIES LISTED ON THE NZX ACCORDING TO THEIR CARBON INTENSITY AND SECTOR IMPACT.'}{'symbol': 'SPGI', 'date': '2021-05-03 18:47:00', 'title': 'R1 RCM SET TO JOIN S&P MIDCAP 400; BANCORP TO JOIN S&P SMALLCAP 600', 'text': 'NEW YORK, MAY 3, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0S&P SMALLCAP 600 CONSTITUENT R1 RCM INC. (NASD:RCM) WILL REPLACE PERSPECTA INC. (NYSE:PRSP) IN THE S&P MIDCAP 400 AND THE BANCORP INC. (NASD:TBBK) WILL REPLACE R1 RCM IN THE S&P SMALLCAP 600 EFFECTIVE PRIOR TO THE OPENING OF TRADING ON FRIDAY, MAY 7.\xa0 VERITAS CAPITAL IS ACQUIRING PERSPECTA IN A DEAL EXPECTED TO BE COMPLETED SOON PENDING FINAL CONDITIONS.'}{'symbol': 'SPGI', 'date': '2021-05-02 18:00:00', 'title': "NEW ZEALAND'S EXCHANGE AND S&P